5%) preserves continuity across boundaries. Top_k=6 balances recall (to capture multi-part answers) and precision (avoiding excessive noise). The prompt is stricter to enforce grounding in context, especially for multi-step reasoning, and explicitly addresses the risk of fragmented chunks. This is the first structural exploration of chunk_size/overlap and top_k.
