ne Paradox, case studies, or psychological explanations). Iteration 1 (chunk_size=1200) showed **high context_recall (0.944)** but **low context_precision (0.873)**, suggesting larger chunks may include noise or irrelevant material. To address this, we **reduce chunk_size to 800** (21% of chars_per_section) to better isolate relevant reasoning units while maintaining continuity (overlap=120, 15%). We also **switch to similarity_score_threshold (0.4)** and **increase top_k to 8** to balance recall (capturing fragmented but relevant material) and precision (filtering out low-relevance chunks). The updated prompt enforces stricter grounding and explicit disclaimers for fragmented or incomplete context, addressing both faithfulness and response_relevancy. This is a **precision-focused trial** (prioritizing context_precision and faithfulness) while maintaining recall via thresholded retrieval.
